Amit, Neha, and Sanjay welcome me.
Amit says, "Maya, we will play together."
We start a doubles match.
Sanjay is my partner.
Neha serves first.
I move quickly on the court.
I hit the shuttle hard.
Amit runs fast.
But he cannot hit the shuttle.
Sanjay becomes happy.
He says, "Wow Maya, you can play very well!"
I smile and thank him.
How good it feels!
I practiced for many years in Mexico.
Therefore, I can run fast on the court.
Our game goes on for a long time.
We get a lot of points.
I have a lot of fun in this match.
